    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131380/extras/af99e8a8ca4aa5a07b48af0277b6d2ad.avif?t=1663365550\" /></div><br>Everything was supposed to have been a beautiful Christmas, but it ended up being interrupted by a cursed and unknown curse..<br>Until Lights Out is inspired by a horror movie story where evil mostly dwells in darkness. A little girl named Claire will go through challenges and through her fears, in search of a possible answer, paranormal activities or just hallucinations, you are alone being watched by an entity whose origin is not known, solve puzzles in search of a truth and try to end the evil.<br><br>Main Features<br><br>- Small game includes puzzles.<br>- Explore one of Claire's house.<br>- The game offers its own atmosphere.<br>- Inspired by a horror movie",
